+- Offline replies are simpler than cloud replies, and the phone model often cannot control the phone reliably.
+- Offline mode works on 64-bit ARM phones only (no x86 emulators).
+- Web apps run in an isolated viewer with no access to your files. Apps that call other websites need internet, and a web app is only as good as the model that wrote it.
 - Speech recognition and voices for Urdu depend on the Google app and voice data on your phone.
